    "detailed_description": "NecroArcher can be best described as a mix between <br>Lord of the Rings and The Hangover movies in the form of a Metroidvania.<br><br>It\u2019s a humorous indie metroidvania game with elements of Hack\u2019n Slash, where you control an undead archer on a mission to save his friend Larry from the clutches of The Evil Witch, aided by Stanley the vampire. But well... it might be more complicated.<br><br>Explore a vast interconnected world and fight a variety of creatures.<br>With a mix of fantasy and coming of age themes, embark on an unforgettable adventure full of humor, personal growth and the triumph of friendship!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903710/extras/f925424b66ddd3aae410894a475d49d6.poster.avif?t=1728832117\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903710/extras/f925424b66ddd3aae410894a475d49d6.webm?t=1728832117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903710/extras/f925424b66ddd3aae410894a475d49d6.mp4?t=1728832117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
